      55.17,
      421.74,
      295.21,
      474.9
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      484.02,
      295.21,
      549.9
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.0525 Hectares,depicted in the Advance Tracing No. CO/KDW/2018/331 dated25.06.2018, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villagecalled Dadigamuwa, in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 480 -Welipillewa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaduwela ofColombo District of Western Province and bounded as follows:",
